# r1106cbb Boot 1: chain jars, group A superflat, fresh config, nch_guard_probe.js copied in before the boot
# (SQ-CBB-01 to -03, -05; SQ-CBB-04 = r1106cba/b1.qb rows 01 to 08 and 10 on the same boot).
## SQ-CBB-01 | chain: removed recipe count back to normal, no refused remove from pack scripts
shell grep -h "Added [0-9]* recipes" logs/kubejs/server.log
shell n=$(grep -oE "removed [0-9]+ recipes" logs/kubejs/server.log | tail -1 | grep -oE "[0-9]+"); echo "removed=$n"; test "$n" -lt 500
bootreject remove refused: filter\.output.*dish_stuffed
shell grep -h "remove refused" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log | head -20
## SQ-CBB-02 | NCH remove guard probe
kjsexpect \[nchguard\] normal remove of minecraft:bread done
shell grep -h "\[nchguard\] case done" logs/kubejs/server.log | sed 's/.*\] //'
shell test "$(grep -h "\[nchguard\] case done" logs/kubejs/server.log | wc -l)" = 4
shell grep -h "remove refused" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log | sed 's/.*remove refused/remove refused/'
shell test "$(grep -h "remove refused" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log | wc -l)" = 4
> zq recipes minecraft:bread
sleep 2
reject \[zq\] minecraft:bread ->
## SQ-CBB-03 | fermenting count, Pale Jane and Steel Toe, bark and metal dust tags in Common
> zq bytype brewinandchewin:fermenting
> zq recipes creativebrewing:fermenting/pale_jane
> zq recipes creativebrewing:fermenting/steel_toe
> zq itemtag immersive_weathering:bark
> zq itemtag creativeengineering:bark
> zq itemtag creativeengineering:metal_dusts
sleep 3
expect bytype brewinandchewin:fermenting: (1[89]|[2-9]\d)$
expect pale_jane_from_rice_wine
expect farmersdelight:tree_bark
bootreject Couldn't load tag|missing references
## SQ-CBB-05 | kippers and forge:raw_fishes on the chain
> zq rdetail brewinandchewin:fermenting/kippers
> zq itemtag forge:raw_fishes
> zq recipes brewinandchewin:fermenting/kippers
sleep 3
look record whether kippers is listed, whether #forge:raw_fishes holds miners_delight:tentacles, and the ingredient list
